{"src":"fr","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":175400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"fr","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"route","t":2102.159259,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":4260.518662,"text":"Lions are the most sociable cats, "},{"kind":"audio","t":4297.556259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":4299.181302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":930},{"kind":"audio","t":4299.866332,"samples":2264,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":5826.0169160000005,"text":"Les lions sont les chats les plus sociables, vivant en grand groupe, populés meutes."},{"kind":"text","t":5994.676036,"text":"living in large groups, called prides. "},{"kind":"audio","t":6033.904356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":6035.01779,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":6035.254286,"samples":7664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":7701.628643,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":9908.229627,"text":"In the hot climate of the Middle East, "},{"kind":"audio","t":9947.090785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9948.503589,"samples":30232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"text","t":10881.528586,"text":"the house was not that important. "},{"kind":"audio","t":10918.335196,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10920.024215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":780},{"kind":"audio","t":10920.192088,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":11126.45749,"text":"Dans le climat chaud du Moyen-Orient, la maison n'était pas si importante."},{"kind":"route","t":12801.945818,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":18066.595028,"text":"Almost all the stones are sandy and allow for safe swimming. "},{"kind":"audio","t":18106.378173,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18107.954673,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18109.663632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":18109.862541,"samples":12096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":19437.390542,"text":"Presque tous les pirages sont sablonneux et permettent de se baigner en toute sécurité, la plupart sont ombragés par des pollues du cacao."},{"kind":"text","t":19595.494044,"text":"Most are shaded by cocoa trees. "},{"kind":"audio","t":19644.980685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":19646.490215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":19646.679269,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":21901.935925,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":25133.496207,"text":"The packs consist of one to three adult males. "},{"kind":"audio","t":25184.672508,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25186.156569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25186.941439,"samples":22064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":360},{"kind":"input","t":27159.214965,"text":"Les meutes sont composées d'un à trois mâles adultes, apparentés ainsi que d'une trentaine de femelles et de lionceaux."},{"kind":"text","t":27378.614432,"text":"related, as well as about thirty females and cubs. "},{"kind":"audio","t":27430.494802,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27432.306035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27433.668543,"samples":31664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"route","t":29201.570864,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":32374.079856,"text":"Feral children may have suffered severe "},{"kind":"audio","t":32424.913243,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32426.587419,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":32426.759528,"samples":10064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":35015.358146,"text":"Les enfants sauvages peuvent avoir suivi de graves abus ou traumatismes avant d'être abandonnés ou de s'enfuir."},{"kind":"text","t":35218.769167000006,"text":"abuse or trauma before being abandoned or running away. "},{"kind":"audio","t":35270.99638900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35272.689384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":35274.45596000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":35274.629571,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":37002.009546,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"input","t":40716.065649,"text":"Le bus 403 de Scotterb se rend régulièrement à Sintra."},{"kind":"text","t":40998.652092000004,"text":"The Scotterb 403 bus runs regularly to Sintra. "},{"kind":"audio","t":41052.73553400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41054.562210000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":41056.361755000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":41057.141086999996,"samples":20496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"route","t":41702.08456,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":43919.414441,"text":"with a stop at Cabo d'Aroca. "},{"kind":"audio","t":43967.97968800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43969.209256,"samples":29632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":660},{"kind":"input","t":44085.001934,"text":"avec un arrêt à cabot d'Aroca."},{"kind":"route","t":45301.952277000004,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":47541.469511999996,"text":"To admire the most beautiful panoramas of Hong Kong, "},{"kind":"audio","t":47580.82053700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47582.578729999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47584.093236999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"audio","t":47584.219205999994,"samples":696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"text","t":50492.380101999996,"text":"leave the island and head to the waterfront "},{"kind":"audio","t":50543.38756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":50544.830309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":50545.047355,"samples":13064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":52041.160013999994,"text":"Pour admirer les plus beaux panoramas de Hong Kong, quittez l'île et rejoignez le front de mer de Kowloon situé en face."},{"kind":"text","t":52161.17836400001,"text":"of Kowloon located opposite. "},{"kind":"audio","t":52197.71836300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52199.427171999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":52199.55885,"samples":1064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":53802.75668599999,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":56078.39445000001,"text":"Aristotle's opinions on all questions. "},{"kind":"audio","t":56129.440867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":56131.050607,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":56131.308424,"samples":11264,"rate":24000},{"kind":"text","t":59917.476070000004,"text":"scientific, including psychology, "},{"kind":"audio","t":59955.331216000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59956.926955,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":59957.037530999994,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":60123.236563,"text":"Les opinions d'Aristote sur toutes les questions scientifiques, y compris la psychologie, ont été acceptées."},{"kind":"text","t":60209.40416599999,"text":"were accepted. "},{"kind":"audio","t":60258.015231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":60258.299008,"samples":8032,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":62301.821951000005,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":66537.383957,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gourlay finished 11th in the Super G, "},{"kind":"audio","t":66589.633452,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":66591.183633,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":66593.006383,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":66593.135457,"samples":4896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":67410.013133,"text":"L'Australien Mitchell Gourlay est arrivé 11e au Super G Debout Homme."},{"kind":"text","t":67526.56251799999,"text":"Stand up, man. "},{"kind":"audio","t":67576.071664,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":67576.37710299999,"samples":10432,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":68202.272101,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"input","t":72788.262774,"text":"Le tchèque Aldrich Jelinek s'est classé 16e au Super JAC Home."},{"kind":"text","t":73104.137223,"text":"The Czech Aldrich Jelinek finished 16th in the Super JAC Home. "},{"kind":"audio","t":73157.13312099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73158.76288,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73160.427893,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73161.172332,"samples":21096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"route","t":75101.426809,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":78192.979656,"text":"The city contrasts sharply with the cities of the "},{"kind":"audio","t":78246.08415699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78247.58972999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78248.247358,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"text","t":81178.33284399999,"text":"rest of the country because it has a style "},{"kind":"audio","t":81216.096958,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":81217.75884499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":81217.939888,"samples":10064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":82314.04646,"text":"La ville contraste fortement avec les cités du reste du pays car elle possède un style davantage arabe qu'africain."},{"kind":"text","t":82434.67085,"text":"more Arabic than African. "},{"kind":"audio","t":82471.47233599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":82472.211537,"samples":24832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"route","t":84601.636915,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":86765.905015,"text":"Also, after the Revolution, "},{"kind":"audio","t":86803.542408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":86804.999108,"samples":30832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"text","t":88780.10242499999,"text":"the trades were opened to all male candidates. "},{"kind":"audio","t":88830.488029,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":88831.97214,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":88832.394605,"samples":16064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"text","t":91701.40609199999,"text":"allowing the most ambitious and talented to "},{"kind":"audio","t":91740.151029,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91741.72785899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91742.523925,"samples":21464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":92058.20249,"text":"Aussi, après la Révolution, les métiers furent ouverts à tous les candidats masculins, permettant aux plus ambitieux et aux plus talentueux de réussir."},{"kind":"text","t":92146.885579,"text":"succeed. "},{"kind":"audio","t":92193.754548,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":92193.991925,"samples":3232,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":93701.380653,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":95848.252555,"text":"The fission bomb works on the principle "},{"kind":"audio","t":95898.07096699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":95899.791753,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":95899.99163399999,"samples":7664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"text","t":99713.37355799999,"text":"following. "},{"kind":"audio","t":99760.940506,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":99761.070011,"samples":2032,"rate":24000},{"kind":"text","t":100867.57451199999,"text":"It converts energy by assembling a nucleus of a myriad of "},{"kind":"audio","t":100922.095562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100923.62703399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100925.377585,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":100925.553089,"samples":11496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101179.935099,"text":"La bombe à fission fonctionne selon le principe suivant. Elle transforme l'énergie en assemblant un noyau d'une myriade de protons et de neutrons."},{"kind":"text","t":101301.128464,"text":"protons and neutrons. "},{"kind":"audio","t":101337.14493,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101337.783941,"samples":23632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"route","t":102701.83539,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":104900.016685,"text":"He did not quantify his reductions, "},{"kind":"audio","t":104935.34129099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104936.958512,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":104937.062568,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":107402.028485,"text":"Il n'a pas chiffré ses réductions, disant qu'elles seront basées sur la production économique chinoise."},{"kind":"text","t":107631.510459,"text":"saying that they will be based on Chinese economic production. "},{"kind":"audio","t":107684.23361699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107686.23512499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107687.823683,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":107687.959137,"samples":6696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":109101.904,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":113384.196211,"text":"There is no universal definition that allows for determining "},{"kind":"audio","t":113424.285098,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113425.791012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":113427.615194,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113428.23148999999,"samples":14496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":115806.68816599999,"text":"Il n'existe pas de définition universelle permettant de déterminer si un objet manufacturé est une antiquité."},{"kind":"text","t":115971.797381,"text":"whether a manufactured object is an antiquity. "},{"kind":"audio","t":116023.725013,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116025.207191,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116026.33282299999,"samples":27464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"route","t":116901.303266,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":121114.591428,"text":"Some tax authorities define goods over 100 "},{"kind":"audio","t":121153.733492,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121155.42846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121157.29557599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":121157.39108999999,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":122083.930907,"text":"Certains organismes fiscaux définissent les biens de plus de 100 ans comme des antiquités."},{"kind":"text","t":122201.93835299999,"text":"years old as antiques. "},{"kind":"audio","t":122252.03655599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122252.82745499999,"samples":24232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"route","t":124501.334043,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":127790.38596,"text":"You don't necessarily need a yacht in the archipelagos. "},{"kind":"audio","t":127828.765258,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127830.51747199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127832.068563,"samples":31664,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":128228.44086799999,"text":"Vous n'avez pas forcément besoin d'un yacht dans les archipels et sur les lacs."},{"kind":"text","t":128345.313299,"text":"and on the lakes. "},{"kind":"audio","t":128392.76958,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":128392.936731,"samples":8632,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":130401.053651,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":132618.431731,"text":"It is therefore said that the aspect ratio of this "},{"kind":"audio","t":132668.692257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132670.534546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":132671.569241,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"text","t":134599.268006,"text":"format is obtained by dividing by 12 to get the most "},{"kind":"audio","t":134651.604332,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134653.375083,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134655.080086,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":134655.19329599998,"samples":7296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":136933.52454399999,"text":"On dit donc que le rapport d'aspect de ce format en divisant par 12 pour obtenir le plus simple des rapports de nombre entier est de 3 sur 2."},{"kind":"text","t":137138.568535,"text":"simple integer ratio is 3 to 2. "},{"kind":"audio","t":137189.522994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137191.25270399998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":137191.47613,"samples":13664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"route","t":138401.548043,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":141619.471637,"text":"Its reputation as an epicenter of luxury began "},{"kind":"audio","t":141658.92354699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141660.542441,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141661.448102,"samples":25064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"text","t":143638.336953,"text":"around the year 400 and lasted until "},{"kind":"audio","t":143678.027912,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143679.619645,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":143680.565837,"samples":24464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"input","t":143862.264928,"text":"Sa réputation en tant qu'épicentre du luxe a débuté aux environs de l'an 400 et a duré jusqu'à 1100 environ."},{"kind":"text","t":144016.51052399998,"text":"around 1100. "},{"kind":"audio","t":144053.525321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":144054.700347,"samples":25432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"route","t":146203.467648,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":148313.414288,"text":"Cancellation policies vary, "},{"kind":"audio","t":148365.250062,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148366.666311,"samples":32032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"text","t":149391.221674,"text":"but starting from the end of March, "},{"kind":"audio","t":149440.8693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149442.164266,"samples":31432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":780},{"kind":"text","t":152398.112647,"text":"most coronavirus-based cancellation policies "},{"kind":"audio","t":152436.547999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152438.342917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":152439.20371,"samples":22064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"text","t":154385.124384,"text":"do not extend through July 2020. "},{"kind":"audio","t":154423.671704,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154425.27340099998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154425.588675,"samples":16064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":157035.450175,"text":"Les politiques d'annulation varient, mais à partir de fin mars, la plupart des politiques d'annulation basées sur le coronavirus ne s'étendent pas jusqu'en juillet 2020, date à laquelle les Jeux Olympiques avaient été prévus."},{"kind":"text","t":157256.37067899999,"text":"the date for which the Olympic Games had been scheduled. "},{"kind":"audio","t":157309.796153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157311.499383,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":157312.223511,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"route","t":159701.417246,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":162923.839542,"text":"mix the two dry powders together and then with the "},{"kind":"audio","t":162975.138419,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162976.607698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":162977.45382,"samples":25664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":164627.922581,"text":"Mélangez les deux poudres sèches ensemble puis avec les mains propres et humides, pressez-les en une boule."},{"kind":"text","t":164847.005463,"text":"clean, damp hands, press them into a ball. "},{"kind":"audio","t":164885.981738,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164887.720862,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":164888.23854,"samples":17864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"route","t":166901.928497,"type":"route","src":"fr"},{"kind":"text","t":170787.821983,"text":"St. Petersburg cruises include time spent in the "},{"kind":"audio","t":170840.170729,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170841.766948,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170842.645058,"samples":26264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":470},{"kind":"text","t":173029.115921,"text":"city. "},{"kind":"audio","t":173076.560715,"samples":30000,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":870},{"kind":"text","t":174144.092176,"text":"Cruise passengers are exempt from visa requirements, "},{"kind":"audio","t":174195.22211899998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174196.840922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174198.512234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":174198.654779,"samples":696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":174472.896951,"text":"Les croisières à Saint-Pétersbourg incluent du temps passé dans la ville. Les passagers des croisières sont exemptés de l'obligation de visa, voire les conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":174577.748773,"text":"see the conditions. "},{"kind":"audio","t":174616.961163,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":174617.48065399998,"samples":14032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":70},{"kind":"close","t":185502.519119,"code":1005}]}